{"parse": {"title": "LPdF-09", "pageid": 114324, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-08\" title=\"LPdF-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LPdF-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-10\" title=\"LPdF-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LPdF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A7.A9.E5.BA.8F.E7.9A.84.E9.BB.84.E6.98.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"秩序的黄昏\">秩序的黄昏</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 秩序的黄昏</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Deadly Dusk</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>很<span class=\"color-value\"></span>遗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>憾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>秩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>序<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 30510109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_04\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-s01_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-s01_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-s01_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>呼……你终于来了，维尔汀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们远远听到下边打斗的声音，幸好艾吉奥先生过来看了一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>别担心，我只是有些头晕。倒是艾吉奥先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧闹的打斗声早已止歇，穹顶内外又恢复了死一般的沉寂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通常情况下，它指向两种结局：好的和坏的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>交给他吧。事实上，临走前我们有过一段对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>敌人是有备而来。我拖住他们，你们先去密室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>可万一这是个陷阱呢？APPLe某有种不太好的预感，不如我们一起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我和圣殿骑士已经打过很多年的交道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客轻抖手腕，袖剑冰冷的白光在阴影中一晃而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他早已做好准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这不是我第一次面对他们的阴谋，也不会是最后一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>你们现在是我的朋友，刺客不会让他的朋友身处险境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客快步走下石阶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在石阶的拐角处，他抬起头，朝APPLe露出一个宽慰的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>别担心，我向你保证……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我们会再次相会的，朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>他是位慷慨无私的先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>也是位敏锐的先生——圣殿骑士的确有备而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我之所以出来，是因为苏芙比小姐和莱昂纳多先生被迷晕了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那个叫阿尔贝托的神父嫌疑很大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>现在他们都被我安置在一个隐蔽的祭坛背后，但我无法保证那里会一直安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这可不是好消息。距离密室还有一段距离，我们可以在路上互相交换一下彼此了解的信息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声沿着狭窄的石阶一步步向上攀爬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>滤光器……象征鸟的乌切洛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>没错，目前我们只取得了这些进展。你们那边呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼神不经意间掠过身后幽暗的甬道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>暂时还没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不过结合你提到的那幅湿壁画，以及老神父之前说的——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_13\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>嗯……穹顶内还有一幅，但那是未完成的。中途被赞助方，也就是羊毛行会叫停了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>除了首席画家乌切洛先生以外，参与壁画工程的一共有十几个人，听说一分钱酬金都没拿到，上帝保佑……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_04\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-s01_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-s01_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Cg-s01_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想，壁画讲的并不是什么晦涩难懂的寓言故事，而是当初乌切洛等人一同在大教堂画画的真实经历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>真实经历？可画中的石头看上去颇有超现实主义的韵味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>假如它也是一个滤光器呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>你是说，乌切洛也有一个滤光器——哦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>的确，滤光器并不是什么很高级的东西，一小片彩色玻璃也能搞定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>那么接下来只需要抵达密室确认一番，就在前面——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_05\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>呃……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本该空旷无人的室内，神父负手沐浴在暖光下，似乎早已等待多时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>看到我很惊讶吗，金色的苹果先生……哦，还有这位助理小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>果然是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>真是机敏的小姑娘。你刻意向同伴隐藏了关于透视的小小发现，就是为了提防被人偷听吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窸窸窣窣的声音在背后响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默的骑士们从阴影中走出，倒影在昏暗的光下交织成一张无形的网。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>看来所谓的“清场”只是一个谎言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>谎言？只是在你们昏睡的时候，让我那些在外暴晒的可怜同胞们进来歇脚罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我不明白……像您这样受人尊敬的神父，为什么要背叛信仰，替圣殿骑士卖命？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神父困惑地皱起眉毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>真奇怪。我从一开始便是圣殿骑士的人，何来背叛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>可你和莱昂纳多先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>即使是最亲密的朋友，彼此之间也有秘密，不是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>会藏匿在阴影中的，可不止刺客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>好吧，这可真是个缺乏信任感的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>对了，他和那位圣母小姐……不得不说你把他们藏得很好，我的人花了很多时间才把他们找出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无视对面焦灼的目光，神父自如地在壁画前踱步，仿佛一位前来瞻仰遗迹的旅客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-635301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-635301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-635301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>真美啊。我一直很喜欢石灰层剥落时的模样。就像层层掩埋的罪恶，随时间不得不暴露在光下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-635301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-635301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-635301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>每一层剥落，都是净化的开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他转过身，虔诚地在胸前画了个十字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>接下来，请为我打开这扇门吧——如果你们还在乎另外两位同伴安危的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我想我有必要提醒你，艾吉奥已经在赶、赶回来的路上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>若要论及对付圣殿骑士，他可是专业的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>略显心虚的宣言并未吓倒神父。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>艾吉奥？很遗憾，他回不来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>呃？APPLe某不明白你的意思……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔贝托负手走到窗前，漠然地俯视下方砖红的屋顶海洋。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_27.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_27\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_27\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-s01_cg_27.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_27.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-s01_cg_27.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_27.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-s01_cg_27.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_27.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-635312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-635312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-635312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>很遗憾，若要论及对付刺客，我们也颇有心得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-635312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-635312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-635312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔贝托：</div><div>今日的佛罗伦萨，将成为他永恒的安息之地。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LPdF-09"}}